[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15902.51, "timestamp": "04:25:02", "text": "致已任命的成员"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15907.03, "timestamp": "04:25:07", "text": "但我很快就会这么做。你好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15911.51, "timestamp": "04:25:11", "text": "所以，嗯，正如你所看到的，Aru Chan是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15913.269, "timestamp": "04:25:13", "text": "其中一位版主是新来的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15916.95, "timestamp": "04:25:16", "text": "版主。啊，第一个是阿鲁"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15920.03, "timestamp": "04:25:20", "text": "陈从……开始"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15923.75, "timestamp": "04:25:23", "text": "A，然后等等，我真的需要吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15926.309, "timestamp": "04:25:26", "text": "按字母顺序排列？等等看是不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15930.189, "timestamp": "04:25:30", "text": "按字母顺序排列，那么接下来是谁？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15934.309, "timestamp": "04:25:34", "text": "好的。你好。然后是下一个排队的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15935.71, "timestamp": "04:25:35", "text": "将要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15939.91, "timestamp": "04:25:39", "text": "我是塞莱斯蒂亚·贾玛。是的。天界虚空"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15942.75, "timestamp": "04:25:42", "text": "来自森林章节。她还申请了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15946.03, "timestamp": "04:25:46", "text": "模。是的，她也得到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15949.71, "timestamp": "04:25:49", "text": "她也进去了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15954.32, "timestamp": "04:25:54", "text": "耶。他现在也是一名版主。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15957.229, "timestamp": "04:25:57", "text": "[音乐]"}]